==Strategy==
Meatshield with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]], and use your regular [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red attackers]], along with some generalists. If you have [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] already, he breaks the stage in half.

